.TH AIRUNNER-DAEMON 1 "October 2026" "airunner 6.1.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
airunner-daemon \- Daemon mode entry point for AI Runner.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B airunner-daemon
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B airunner-daemon
is the daemon mode entry point for AI Runner. It starts the headless
services daemon (FastAPI server, runtime registry, lifecycle control)
using the packaged default configuration, loopback-only by default.
.PP
This is the services-only package: it contains no Qt desktop client.
Heavy ML extras (torch, diffusers, llama.cpp bindings) are not
Debian-packaged; install them from PyPI when a workload needs them.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/airunner/daemon.yaml
Daemon configuration, seeded from the packaged example on first install.
.TP
.I /var/lib/airunner
Writable daemon state (runtime configs/sockets, cache, models).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR airunner-headless (1),
.BR airunner-service (1),
https://github.com/Capsize-Games/airunner
